<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53763" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάγειος</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάγαιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under the
				earth, subterranean</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θησαυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.150
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.97
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.5.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					514a
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prt.</u>
				320e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ κ</span>. from <i>below
				ground</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				532b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκίσκος κ</span>. v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>on the ground</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κ</span>.
				<i>ground-floor</i> rooms, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερῷα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				10.32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρουθοὶ κ</span>. ostriches,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.175
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				192
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατώγειος</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάγειον</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάγαιον, τό</span>, <i>cellar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				75.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
